• Solid task and project management skills, with the ability to organize deadlines and resources across multiple production cycles at once.

• Comfort navigating ambiguity, able to handle unexpected problems (delays, quality issues) with clarity and composure.

• A collaborative mindset, able to build strong partnerships with creative and e-store teams.

• An interest in or understanding of the video game industry is a plus.

Dans ce rôle tu devras :

